th others. Explore fun secrets and collect all the collectable cosmetics! We Computer World developers hope you and your friends have a great time playing!", "short_description": "\"Computer World\" is a fun unique VR game! It uses your hands to move around, and there is multiplayer to connect with others. You also play as Computers that can play many fun game modes like Hangout, Robbery, Low Gravity, Parkour, and even so much more!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://computerworldvrofficialwebsite.my.canva.site/#page-PB2DH4srCl5Tb6B2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://computerworldvrofficialwebsite.my.canva.site/page-2", "publisher_name": "Dove", "support_website_url": "https://computerworldvrofficialwebsite.my.canva.site/", "website_url": "https://computerworldvrofficialwebsite.my.canva.site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25115590161360853"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619534_9786565768113010_5709949618498889333_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ZCv1sBHg-IQ7kNvwEnCNUI&_nc_oc=AdrJliK3pmW-869t3fRnok4g2D1lkgknXyM-IiZCOAbWO--UhMXoHd71Tmbn2COB0nc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL7pD6YUwyWXIscN4L21NqEXjuStTFsvA3M3I